{"id":"149529016ea0336c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Symmetric System Of Models","display":"df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models — ZFC Forcing Symmetric System Of Models","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models — ZFC Forcing Symmetric System Of Models","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-countable]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models — ZFC Forcing Symmetric System Of Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\theta,L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\theta,L\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> 为既有纯成员语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span> 见 proper 文件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S\\)</span> 分别是三元初等子结构和四元结构同构谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 的原名称及元数；下标只是兼容名称的一部分，不另引入元语言语义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSymmetricSystemOfModels}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSymmetricSystemOfModels}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,L)\n\\leftrightarrow L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,L)\n\\leftrightarrow L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\sigma,M,N,L)\n\\leftrightarrow L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(\\sigma,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,L)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\sigma,M,N,L)\n\\leftrightarrow L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(\\sigma,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,L)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}system\\text{-}of\\text{-}models}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSymmetricSystemOfModels}_S(\\mathcal M,\\theta,L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1\\in\\theta\n\\land\\exists H\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal P(H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,L)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(M\\cap\\omega_1=N\\cap\\omega_1\n\\to\\exists!\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\sigma,M,N,L)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\cap N\\;(\\sigma(x)=x)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}system\\text{-}of\\text{-}models}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSymmetricSystemOfModels}_S(\\mathcal M,\\theta,L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1\\in\\theta\n\\land\\exists H\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal P(H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,L)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(M\\cap\\omega_1=N\\cap\\omega_1\n\\to\\exists!\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\sigma,M,N,L)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\cap N\\;(\\sigma(x)=x)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>定义所用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>、成员结构、初等性与同构均由本书已有集合谓词展开。未增加有限性、闭包性或其他版本“对称系统”可能要求的附加条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}$ 取 [[58-df-regular-cardinal]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Countable}$ 取 [[58-df-countable]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\theta,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSymmetricSystemOfModels}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,L)\n\\leftrightarrow L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,L)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\sigma,M,N,L)\n\\leftrightarrow L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(\\sigma,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,L)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}system\\text{-}of\\text{-}models}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSymmetricSystemOfModels}_S(\\mathcal M,\\theta,L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1\\in\\theta\n\\land\\exists H\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal P(H)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{MembershipElementary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,L)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(M\\cap\\omega_1=N\\cap\\omega_1\n\\to\\exists!\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{MembershipIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\sigma,M,N,L)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\cap N\\;(\\sigma(x)=x)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"H_\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":3074,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1994","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-symmetric-system-of-models]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1b3610e6aed65b25","0fbfc19800246e77","8935dcac821c0104","e91c1261e1c2374b","01f4b76e2e096590"]}